<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Sunday's English</p>
<p>premier league matches:</p>
<p>Blackburn 3 (Sutton penalty 3rd minute, 56, Wilcox 24)</p>
<p>Liverpool 0. Halftime 2-0. Attendance: 29,598</p>
<p>Newcastle 3 (Beardsley penalty 40, 69. Lee 74) Middlesbrough 1</p>
<p>(Beck 88). 1-0. 36,577.</p>
</text>
